  "outcome": "not-supported",
  "finding": "All 110 cases completed: 110 distinct page outputs, 990 fixed-opening comparisons and zero matches. Every output also equals the whole-stream reversal of its within-segment sibling.",
  "limitations": "Only nine exact beginnings are tested, not general readability. Segments are transcription-defined, not established plaintext words. Prior sibling results were known. Algebraic consistency is not independent evidence. Human review pending.",
  "next_steps": "Declare row-local reversal, heading removal, other boundaries or combined substitution as separate scopes. Broader language evaluation needs a predeclared scoring and validation procedure.",
